        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Rattled by the Rush\", \"Wowee Zowee\"\n- People: Pavement\n- Places: Stockton, California\n- Topics: indie rock, reunion tours\n\nFacts:\n- Pavement was an American indie rock band that formed in Stockton, California in 1989.\n- \"Rattled by the Rush\" is a single/EP by Pavement released in 1995.\n- \"Rattled by the Rush\" was the single for the song of the same name, which was the first single from Pavement's third album, \"Wowee Zowee\" (1995).\n- Pavement undertook a well-received reunion tour in 2010.",
